{%- comment -%}
  Single source of truth for the 9 real product families — name,
  preview description, and the title keyword(s) used to sort a product
  into that family (Shopify has no real per-family Collections behind
  these, so matching happens against product.title). Every surface that
  lists families (Shop mega-menu, Shop All sub-nav + filtering, mobile
  drawer) should pull from this rather than keeping its own copy, so
  the list can't drift out of sync again.

  This snippet is rendered (not included — some shops disable
  the include tag outright, which is why this used to be an assign+
  include and broke). {% render %} runs in an isolated scope, so
  instead of assigning a variable this just outputs the raw string;
  callers capture that output and split it themselves:

    {%- capture pm_families_raw -%}{% render 'pm-family-data' %}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign pm_families = pm_families_raw | strip | split: ';;' -%}

  Format per entry: Name|Preview description|keyword1,keyword2,...|collection handle
  (the family's own Shopify collection; links fall back to ?family= if it's missing)
  Entries joined by ";;".
{%- endcomment -%}
{{- 'Pouches|Soft crystal pouches, worn crossbody or in hand.|Pouch|pouches;;Mini Roma|A smaller take on the signature Roma.|Mini Roma|mini-roma;;Mini Milano|Milano architecture, scaled down.|Milano|mini-milano;;Santorini|Sun-bleached crystal, inspired by the Cyclades.|Santorini|santorini;;Maxi Roma|The Roma silhouette, in its fullest form.|Maxi Roma|maxi-roma;;Clutch Micro|The Clutch silhouette, scaled to its smallest form.|Clutch Micro|clutch-micro;;Clutches|Compact, hand-set crystal clutches for evening.|Clutch|clutches-1;;Wood Net Hobo|Hand-netted crystal over a wood frame.|Hobo,Wood Net|wood-net;;Wallets|Compact crystal wallets, sized to fit a phone.|Wallet|wallets' -}}
